   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "No ack (tunnel, coverage gap)? The anchor keeps the result and publishes it again on the next car/42/attach, until the deadline rules give up (C12).\nThe car never needs to know where its anchor is, and the anchor never needs the address of the zone serving the car: MQTT topics route everything.",
   "originalText": "No ack (tunnel, coverage gap)? The anchor keeps the result and publishes it again on the next car/42/attach, until the deadline rules give up (C12).\nThe car never needs to know where its anchor is, and the anchor never needs the address of the zone serving the car: MQTT topics route everything.",
   "fontSize": 16,
